    "body": "This `regex.strip()` breaks valid patterns such as `regex=\"\\n\"` or `regex=\" \"`, we cannot fail these legitimate requests. I believe you copied this guard from the same guard above for json. In case of json string that consists of whitespaces only is not a valid json object. But in case of regex this is not true. So, we definitely need to remove this guard for regex.",
